{"4179060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Microwave Simulator", "steam_appid": 4179060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happens when you put a rubber duck, a smartphone, or a goldfish inside a oven?</strong> <br>Welcome to <strong>Oven Simulator</strong> - the ultimate absurd sandbox where curiosity meets chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with hundreds of everyday (and not-so-everyday) objects. Watch them heat, melt, explode, or… transform into something completely unexpected. Each item reacts differently based on time, temperature, and its material.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Realistic Reactions:</strong> From popcorn to metal forks - everything has consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Endless Experiments:</strong> Mix random items, discover hidden combinations, and unlock secret results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple, Satisfying Controls:</strong> Just pick it, place it, and press <i>Start</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🫧 <strong>Relax, Laugh, or Go Wild:</strong> No goals, no rules - just chaos, creativity, and curiosity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oven Simulator is not about winning - it’s about wondering <i>“what if?”</i><br>Push the button… and see what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happens when you put a rubber duck, a smartphone, or a goldfish inside a oven?</strong> <br>Welcome to <strong>Oven Simulator</strong> - the ultimate absurd sandbox where curiosity meets chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with hundreds of everyday (and not-so-everyday) objects. Watch them heat, melt, explode, or… transform into something completely unexpected. Each item reacts differently based on time, temperature, and its material.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Realistic Reactions:</strong> From popcorn to metal forks - everything has consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Endless Experiments:</strong> Mix random items, discover hidden combinations, and unlock secret results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple, Satisfying Controls:</strong> Just pick it, place it, and press <i>Start</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🫧 <strong>Relax, Laugh, or Go Wild:</strong> No goals, no rules - just chaos, creativity, and curiosity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oven Simulator is not about winning - it’s about wondering <i>“what if?”</i><br>Push the button… and see what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An absurd sandbox where you put random objects in a oven and see what happens. Heat, melt, explode, or discover the unexpected.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179060/fe1006df2e3d3ee5aed94d5ebf17c2ff36115f00/header.jpg?t=1782211032", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179060/f1ad18a1548db1126190bf25b91d26a42ba949dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782211032", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179060/f1ad18a1548db1126190bf25b91d26a42ba949dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782211032", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li